'''Capixaba''' (from {{Langx|yrl|kopisaba|lit=clearing}}) is a [[Cantons of Balisca|canton]]/city in the [[Carpinchera]] region of [[Bayara]], located on the western shore of [[Lake Piríkui]]. It is considered an {{W|satellite city|accessory city}} to the larger [[Macaio|Macaio Metropolis]]. It recorded a population of 1,882,261 in the [[2025 Baliscan census|2025 census]], ranking as the fifth largest city in Bayara and the [[List of largest cities in Balisca|X-largest]] city in Balisca. 

